# Duplicate copies produced by file-sync tools (iCloud, Dropbox, OneDrive):
# "loader.py" becomes "loader 2.py". They are byte-identical to the original, so
# committing them is pure noise, and pytest happily collects the copies and
# reports twice the real number of tests.
* [0-9].*
# Same thing for files with no extension: "Dockerfile 2", ".gitignore 2".
* [0-9]
